Flower Can was added in '''Beta 30.0''' with the ability to summon 2 Green Flowers upon death. It had stats of 3G 2/3, but the first change in '''Beta 52.0''' gave it +1 cost and ATK, ending it at 4G 3/3.

=== Stats ===
ATK:
* 2 (Post Beta 30.0)
* 3 (Post Beta 52.0, Current)
HP: 3

Cost:
* 3 (Post Beta 30.0)
* 4 (Post Beta 52.0, Current)
Ability: Dust: Summon 2 Green Flowers.

Rarity: White (Common)
